<LegalPage title="Cookie Policy" description="Which cookies and browser storage DealsSite and its partners use.">
  <p>This page explains the cookies and similar technologies used on DealsSite.</p>

  <h2>Storage we use ourselves</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Theme:</strong> remembers light or dark mode.</li>
    <li><strong>Country:</strong> remembers the country you picked, if you chose one manually.</li>
    <li><strong>Sidebar and notifications:</strong> remember whether the sidebar is collapsed and when you last checked new discounts.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>These use your browser's local storage, not tracking cookies.</p>

  <h2>Advertising cookies</h2>
  <p>Google and other advertising partners may set cookies to show relevant ads and to measure them. You can manage personalised ads in <a href="https://www.google.com/settings/ads" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google Ads Settings</a>.</p>

  <h2>Affiliate cookies</h2>
  <p>When you follow a link to a brand, the brand or an affiliate network may set a cookie so a purchase can be credited.</p>

  <h2>Controlling cookies</h2>
  <p>You can block or delete cookies in your browser settings. Some site features may not work as expected if you do.</p>

  <p>See also our <a href="/privacy-policy">Privacy Policy</a>.</p>
</LegalPage>
